---
import Legal from "../../layouts/Legal.astro";
import { SITE } from "../../lib/site";
---

<Legal lang="en" title="Terms of use" path="/en/terms">
  <h2>Provider</h2>
  <p>{SITE.operator}. Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What you buy</h2>
  <p>
    Finisher is digital content: a training plan for one race, a gel schedule, split times, exercises and a checklist. The plan is
    calculated by rules from the data you enter. It is not personal coaching and not medical or nutritional advice. See also
    <a href="/en/health">Health and safety</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Price and payment</h2>
  <p>
    You pay once, there is no subscription. The price including VAT is shown before purchase. Payment is handled by {SITE.paymentProvider},
    which is the seller for this purchase and issues the invoice. Its terms also apply.
  </p>

  <h2>Delivery</h2>
  <p>
    After payment you get a link to the “My plan” page with the full plan, the PDF and calendar export. The link is your access, so do not
    share it publicly. If you lose it, write to us from the address you paid with.
  </p>

  <h2>Right of withdrawal</h2>
  <p>
    The plan is digital content not supplied on a physical medium. At purchase you expressly agree that delivery starts immediately and
    acknowledge that you thereby lose the 14-day right of withdrawal. If the plan does not open or work because of a technical fault, write
    to us and we will fix it or refund you.
  </p>

  <h2>Use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The plan is for your personal use. Do not resell or publish it.</li>
    <li>The data you enter must be accurate, otherwise the plan will not fit you.</li>
    <li>The plan is calculated from the purchase date to the race date and does not change afterwards.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    We do not guarantee a race result. You are responsible for your health and your decisions during training. We are liable for damage
    only to the extent that liability cannot be excluded under applicable law. Your statutory consumer rights are not affected.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The terms in force on the day of purchase apply to it. The law of the Republic of Slovenia applies. We try
    to resolve disputes amicably; consumers can also use the EU online dispute resolution platform.
  </p>
</Legal>
